# Rough documentation (needs review)

This project is a full-stack machine learning application designed to demonstrate how AI/ML models can be integrated into real-world systems. It focuses on solving classification problems and includes:

Document Classification – Categorize documents into predefined classes.
Image Classification – Identify and classify images using ML models.
PII Scanning – Detect sensitive information (names, emails, IDs) in documents using Python and TypeScript implementations.
Backend REST API – Expose inference endpoints for seamless integration.
Database Schemas – Support for MySQL, PostgreSQL, and Oracle.
Containerized Deployment – Using Podman for portability and scalability.
Modular Architecture – Ensures maintainability and easy extension.

This project demonstrates end-to-end ML integration, including model training, inference, API development, and secure data handling.
